+      (`results/experiment_4048_decentralization_moe_base_raw.checkpoint.json`)
+      is INTACT and ready for `.376 exp4069 to resume toward N>=30.
+    - EFFICIENCY (verifier-as-action-pruner, Exp 4061) and ACCURACY (9th game,
